WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.420
Welcome to Product Integration. In this lesson, we explore this purpose: Assemble components into a functioning solution while managing interfaces.

2
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:21.030
Consider this scenario. Two modules pass independent tests but fail when combined. First understand the problem before producing documentation.

3
00:00:21.030 --> 00:00:31.190
Start with two steps: Map components and interfaces. Then Plan integration sequence. Each step should be explained and evidenced.

4
00:00:31.190 --> 00:00:40.000
Continue with Integrate incrementally. Then Verify combined behavior. Verify the results against the intended outcome.

5
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.690
Stronger evidence looks like this: Stronger: contemporaneous integration plan, interface specifications, build test results tied to real work. Weaker evidence would be: Weaker: postponing interface validation until release week; no trace of consistent use. Triangulate independent sources.

6
00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:14.940
Now your turn. Review four documents and two interviews, identify inconsistencies and complete the mastery challenge. This video is an independent teaching explanation, not official CMMI model wording.
